### ======================================
### Enterprise Module Test
### Author: OpenCode
### Version: v1.1
### ======================================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### 文件上传
### ============================

### 上传文件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello ERP System!
--boundary123--


### ============================
### Excel 导出
### ============================

### 导出商品数据
GET http://localhost:8080/api/excel/products/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet


### ============================
### （可选）Excel 导入
### ============================

### 导入商品数据（需要准备 products.xlsx 文件）
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/excel/products/import
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123
#
# --boundary123
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.xlsx"
# Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
#
# < /path/to/products.xlsx
# --boundary123--


### ============================
### 边界测试
### ============================

### 上传 .exe 文件（应被后续扩展限制）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="malware.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

malicious code here
--boundary123--


### 空参数上传（无文件字段 → 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notfile"; filename="nope.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

nothing
--boundary123--
